# Watchdog drivers. The watchdog itself stays, and so do the three
# that a PC or a virtual machine actually has: iTCO on Intel
# chipsets, WDAT for the one ACPI describes, and i6300esb, which is
# what qemu emulates. The other 37 are for boards this is not.
